{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Revenue Review: 2024 vs 2025"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[Revenue fell 12.0%, from $4.21M to $3.71M]{#c1}. The decline was broad, but not even: one segment accounts for most of it."
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Where the decline came from"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[Mid-market revenue dropped $275K, 54% of the total decrease]{#c2}. In 2025, [Enterprise remained the largest segment, at 53% of revenue]{#c3}.\n\nLost accounts explain much of the gap: [142 accounts churned, taking $1.02M of prior-year revenue with them]{#c4}."
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "type": "chart",
      "caption": "Revenue by segment and year",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "id": "q-seg-delta",
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "spec": {
        "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
