          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Accounts behind the decline"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[The largest single decline was Northwind Traders, down $84.2K]{#c6}, and [the three largest declines together came to $201K]{#c7}. [The decline is concentrated in accounts that renewed onto the new pricing tier]{#c5}."
    },
